        "text": "How to Make Sure Your Water Is Safe to Drink When You’re Pregnant Medically Reviewed by Rebecca Amaru, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "1da1ed6d934745af7bcd1e932ea4d49dd38d88fa08afcab57c513dc8a0c45fbf",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
